@startuml ContextOS_Deployment_Architecture
title ContextOS Deployment Architecture\nConfirmed: local Docker Compose POC (BRD §15); VPC/Enterprise V2

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
}

cloud "Developer Workstation / Local POC (Confirmed)" as Local {
  node "VS Code\n+ ContextOS Extension" as VSCode #DCFCE7
  node "CLI contextos" as CLI #DCFCE7
  
  node "Docker Compose" as DC {
    node "contextos-api\nFastAPI :8000?\n(port Missing Evidence — Proposed 8000)" as API #DCFCE7
    database "Qdrant\n:6333\ncollection codebase" as Qdrant #DCFCE7
    database "FalkorDB\n:6379" as Falkor #FEF3C7
  }
  
  node "Serena MCP\n(local process / MCP host)" as Serena #DCFCE7
  node "Embedding model cache\nall-MiniLM-L6-v2 ~90MB CPU" as Emb #DCFCE7
  folder "Local Git repos\n./repos/..." as Repos
}

cloud "Optional Query-time LLM (Consent required)" as LLMCloud {
  node "Gemini / GPT-4\nor local Ollama" as LLM
}

cloud "V2 Enterprise / VPC (Confirmed direction; details Missing Evidence)" as VPC #E0F2FE {
  node "VPC Network" as Net {
    node "Orchestrator replicas\n(availability 99.5% indexer target)" as API_HA
    database "Qdrant (VPC)" as Q_VPC
    database "FalkorDB (VPC)" as F_VPC
    database "Memory store" as M_VPC
    node "OTel Collector\n→ metrics backend (vendor NEEDS CLARIFICATION)" as OTel
  }
  node "RBAC policy enforcement\nper repo path" as RBAC
}

cloud "CI" as CI {
  node "GitHub Action\n(trigger/payload Missing Evidence)" as GHA #FEF3C7
}

VSCode --> API : HTTPS/HTTP loopback
CLI --> API
API --> Qdrant
API --> Falkor
API --> Emb
API --> Serena
API --> Repos : read (gitignore policy)
API ..> LLM : compressed context only
GHA --> API

API_HA --> Q_VPC
API_HA --> F_VPC
API_HA --> M_VPC
API_HA --> OTel
API_HA --> RBAC

note bottom of DC
  **Zero Risk POC (BRD §15):**
  $0 infra — FalkorDB, Qdrant, Serena OSS
  Docker Compose; solo-dev timeline 2–3 weeks
  MVP can run with Qdrant + API + Serena
  even if FalkorDB container present but unused until V1
end note

note bottom of VPC
  Air-gapped on-prem without enterprise tier:
  OUT OF SCOPE (BRD §6).
  K8s/Ingress/TLS termination: Not evidenced —
  require ADR before adoption.
end note

legend right
  |= Color |= Phase |
  | <#DCFCE7> | MVP-capable |
  | <#FEF3C7> | V1-oriented |
  | <#E0F2FE> | V2 enterprise |
endlegend

@enduml
